  "integrationIdentity": "PR #307 merged the reviewed 1.2.0 candidate into main without squashing. The annotated tag v1.2.0 peels to the exact tested main revision 75dbaf5519de5b0dac5bd0c810fdb0bbbbc07966. v1.1.0 still peels to 8e25b301c67ab946b2071cdaee14d83b7ce2250a, an ancestor of the 1.2.0 revision, and every PR merged to main between the two releases is in 1.2.0. 1.0.1 to 1.0.3 were cut from release/1.0.x and are not ancestors of 1.2.0; their fixes reached main before 1.1.0.",
